{"seq":378,"elapsed_ms":3156,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"We need answer only DUT. Need implement decade counter counts 1 through 10 inclusive, output q 4 bits. reset active high synchronous resets to 1. Need decide encoding. Counts 1..10 then back 1. Since q 4 bits, values 1..10. On reset q<=1. On posedge clk if reset q<=1; else if q==10 q<=1; else q<=q+1.\n\nNeed SystemVerilog module TopModule. Return between [BEGIN] and [DONE]. No explanation.\n\nEnsure output q declared logic [3:0] or reg. Port q output [3:0]. Use always_ff @(posedge clk). Reset synchronous active high no async. \n\nLet's craft.\n\n[BEGIN]\nmodule TopModule (\n    input  logic clk,\n    input  logic reset,\n    output logic [3:0] q\n);\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset) begin\n            q <= 4'd1;\n        end else if (q == 4'd10) begin\n            q <= 4'd1;\n        end else begin\n            q <= q + 4'd1;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n[DONE]"}}}
{"seq":379,"elapsed_ms":3156,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"[BEGIN]\nmodule TopModule (\n    input  logic clk,\n    input  logic reset,\n    output logic [3:0] q\n);\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset) begin\n            q <= 4'd1;\n        end else if (q == 4'd10) begin\n            q <= 4'd1;\n        end else begin\n            q <= q + 4'd1;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n[DONE]"}}}
